<title>DENMARK: Radiometer H1 1996/97 profits down 20 pct.</title>
<headline>Radiometer H1 1996/97 profits down 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Oct 31, 1996</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net result		    74.2  vs 101.1</p>
<p> Group pre-tax result	     116.2  vs 145.5</p>
<p> Group net turnover		 821.2  vs 792.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish medical measuring equipment manufacturing group is Radiometer A/S. It said in a statement that it still expected full-year profits after tax of 200 million crowns. The half-year result was below average analyst expectations of an interim 147.3 million crown pre-tax profit.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom, 45-33-969650</p>
</text>
